  designNotes: "Beat 4: the charge. Shield bearers advance 1.1/turn and the wire
    buys one extra volley for the player who reads the board. Moved up from L6 \u2014
    panic and relief belong early, not after the elevation lesson. Checkpoint pulled
    8.6 -> 7.2 (separation was 18.1, and the enemy cluster was 11.4 wide, over rule
    2) and the garrison raised to 10 of 17."
